abstract: >
  A Shiny-based interface to the R-ODAF DESeq2 pipeline that enforces fixed,
  auditable thresholds for reproducible RNA-seq DEG analysis. Deployed at r-odaf.nl;
  project environment captured via renv for rebuildability.
